    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32006" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκθερίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>reap</i> or <i>mow completely,</i> of a crop, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θέρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					53.21
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PEdgar</u>
				27.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Le.</u>
				19.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				3.16
			</span></i> : metaph. of men, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς γηγενεῖς
				ἐξεθερίσατε</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1031
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				373
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				4.6.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cut out,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν γλῶσσαν ἐκθερίξω</span> (aor.
			subj.) <i><span class="en">
				<u>Anacreont.</u>
				9.7
			</span></i>.</div>
